+# coupon-discounts Specification
+
+## Purpose
+TBD - created by archiving change fix-coupon-base-and-last-day. Update Purpose after archive.
+
+## Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Coupon applies to the subtotal after volume discounts
+A coupon SHALL take its percentage, or its fixed amount up to the subtotal, off the order's subtotal after volume discounts, in integer cents rounded half up, subject to the 50%-of-gross cap on all discounts together.
+
+#### Scenario: Percentage coupon with a volume discount
+- **WHEN** an order has 12 units at 500 cents (gross 6000, volume discount 600, subtotal 5400) and a 10% coupon
+- **THEN** the coupon takes 540 cents off and the goods come to 4860 cents
+
+#### Scenario: Percentage coupon without a volume discount
+- **WHEN** an order has 9 units at 500 cents (4500) and a 10% coupon
+- **THEN** the coupon takes 450 cents off and the goods come to 4050 cents
+
+#### Scenario: Rounding at half a cent
+- **WHEN** the subtotal after volume discounts is 1005 cents and the coupon is 10% (100.5 cents)
+- **THEN** the coupon takes 101 cents off
+
+#### Scenario: Fixed coupon never exceeds the subtotal
+- **WHEN** the subtotal after volume discounts is 5400 cents and a fixed coupon is 6000 cents
+- **THEN** the coupon takes at most 5400 cents off, further limited by the 50% cap on gross
+
+### Requirement: Coupon validity includes both its first and last day
+A coupon SHALL be redeemable on every day from its first day to its last day, both included.
+
+#### Scenario: Last day
+- **WHEN** a coupon is valid from 2026-09-01 to 2026-11-30 and is used on 2026-11-30
+- **THEN** it is accepted
+
+#### Scenario: Day after the last day
+- **WHEN** the same coupon is used on 2026-12-01
+- **THEN** it is refused as expired
+
+#### Scenario: First day
+- **WHEN** the same coupon is used on 2026-09-01
+- **THEN** it is accepted
+
+#### Scenario: Day before the first day
+- **WHEN** the same coupon is used on 2026-08-31
+- **THEN** it is refused as not valid yet
